    "created_at": "2019-09-11T13:43:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-11T13:43:45Z",
    "body": "We should specify that browsers can include it, probably at the point where they also include the `Host` header and such, such that it is not exposed to service workers, but is to servers, but why should we CORS safelist it? Wouldn't that allow sites to spoof it?\r\n\r\ncc @mnot ",
